ers is `tests/cshim/shim.c`, which `#include`s `c_src/src/lib.c` verbatim — `c_src` itself is untouched (only the instructed `build/` dir added). Rust side is an **off-by-default** `internal_test_api` feature, so the shipped `.so` still exports only `memchra2`.\n\n71 tests, 1:1 with the 71 documented rows (verified mechanically — no row without a test, no test without a row), ~150 k randomized cases with a fixed seed.\n\n**Phase D — parity & combos** via `./run_verification.sh` (enumerates the feature power set from `Cargo.toml`):\n\n```\nfeatures <none>            : symbols OK, 20 tests pass, 0 warnings\nfeatures internal_test_api : symbols OK, 71 tests pass, 0 warnings\nextra: release profile (panic=abort, optimised) : 71 pass\nextra: C side rebuilt with -O2                  : 71 pass\n=== ALL FEATURE COMBINATIONS PASSED ===\n```\n\nTwo failures surfaced during the work, both in my own harness (an `i32::MIN` negation overflow, and a generated case that read past a `Vec` — UB in C, hence not comparable); the C was never modified and never second-guessed."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1705,"cache_read_input_tokens":148357,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1705,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6679050f-fe9a-4a2d-a894-fc694f76821d","uuid":"26b9a032-b8e4-4bdc-9043-149493e68cc8","timestamp":"2026-08-19T22:10:55.898Z"}
